			"description": "Autocannon Ammunition, Solid Shot (20)",
			"local_notes": "One full magazine load per the autocannon's shots rating.\n\nLore: Depicted as belted or clipped heavy-calibre shells, hauled by the loader in a Heavy Weapons Squad.\n\nDesign: Generic ammunition line so autocannon resupply has a weight and cost; not separately anchored.",
