			"description": "Mortar Bomb, HE (1)",
			"local_notes": "One round for the mortar.\n\nLore: Carried in padded satchels by the mortar team's loader/ammo carrier.\n\nDesign: Ammunition line for the mortar's HE usage above; damage and derivation are given there.",
